---
/**
 * Post lifecycle: the exact call sequence `postiee post "..."` performs, with
 * the three traps annotated where they occur.
 */
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 720 420" role="img" aria-labelledby="lifecycle-title lifecycle-desc">
  <title id="lifecycle-title">What happens when postiee creates a post</title>
  <desc id="lifecycle-desc">
    Five steps: read credentials, resolve the member URN from the OpenID
    userinfo endpoint, optionally upload an image in two steps, create the post
    and read the ID from the x-restli-id response header, then record it in a
    local SQLite database with full-text search.
  </desc>

  <defs>
    <marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5"
            markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#86868c" />
    </marker>
    <marker id="arrow-accent" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5"
            markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#2997ff" />
    </marker>
  </defs>

  <rect width="720" height="420" fill="#000000" rx="6" />

  <!-- Step 1 -->
  <rect x="24" y="24" width="200" height="56" rx="6"
        fill="#121215" stroke="#2a2f3a" />
  <text x="40" y="48" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="600">
    1. read credentials
  </text>
  <text x="40" y="66" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11">
    ~/.config/postiee/
  </text>

  <line x1="224" y1="52" x2="268" y2="52" stroke="#86868c" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />

  <!-- Step 2 -->
  <rect x="272" y="24" width="212" height="56" rx="6"
        fill="#121215" stroke="#ffd60a" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <text x="288" y="44" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="600">
    2. resolve member URN
  </text>
  <text x="288" y="60" fill="#ffd60a" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    GET /v2/userinfo
  </text>
  <text x="288" y="73" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    openid scope
  </text>

  <!-- trap 1 callout -->
  <rect x="500" y="24" width="196" height="56" rx="6"
        fill="#1c1808" stroke="#ffd60a" />
  <text x="512" y="44" fill="#ffd60a" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    TRAP
  </text>
  <text x="512" y="60" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    person ids are
  </text>
  <text x="512" y="73" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    app-scoped
  </text>

  <line x1="484" y1="52" x2="496" y2="52" stroke="#ffd60a" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

  <line x1="378" y1="80" x2="378" y2="112" stroke="#86868c" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />

  <!-- Step 3 (optional branch) -->
  <rect x="120" y="116" width="216" height="56" rx="6"
        fill="#121215" stroke="#2a2f3a" />
  <text x="136" y="136" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="600">
    3. upload image (opt)
  </text>
  <text x="136" y="152" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    initializeUpload → PUT → urn
  </text>
  <text x="136" y="166" fill="#86868c" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    two steps, no finalizeUpload
  </text>

  <rect x="360" y="116" width="336" height="56" rx="6"
        fill="#1c1808" stroke="#ffd60a" />
  <text x="374" y="136" fill="#ffd60a" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    TRAP
  </text>
  <text x="374" y="152" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    images have NO finalizeUpload step —
  </text>
  <text x="374" y="166" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    that is a Videos API concept
  </text>

  <line x1="378" y1="172" x2="378" y2="204" stroke="#86868c" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />

  <!-- Step 4 -->
  <rect x="120" y="208" width="300" height="72" rx="6"
        fill="#121215" stroke="#ff6961" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <text x="136" y="230" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="600">
    4. create the post
  </text>
  <text x="136" y="248" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    POST /rest/posts  →  201 Created
  </text>
  <text x="136" y="262" fill="#ff6961" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12" font-weight="600">
    body is EMPTY — id is in x-restli-id
  </text>
  <text x="136" y="275" fill="#86868c" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    LinkedIn-Version: 202609
  </text>

  <rect x="440" y="208" width="256" height="72" rx="6"
        fill="#1c0e0e" stroke="#ff6961" />
  <text x="454" y="230" fill="#ff6961" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    THE TRAP THAT MATTERS
  </text>
  <text x="454" y="248" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    r_member_social is CLOSED.
  </text>
  <text x="454" y="262" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    No API can read your posts back.
  </text>
  <text x="454" y="275" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    Miss this id → post is unrecoverable.
  </text>

  <line x1="420" y1="244" x2="436" y2="244" stroke="#ff6961" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

  <line x1="270" y1="280" x2="270" y2="312" stroke="#2997ff" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-accent)" />

  <!-- Step 5 -->
  <rect x="120" y="316" width="300" height="72" rx="6"
        fill="#0a1a0d" stroke="#30d158" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <text x="136" y="338" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="600">
    5. record locally
  </text>
  <text x="136" y="356" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    SQLite + FTS5 index
  </text>
  <text x="136" y="370" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    post_id, body, media_urn, created_at
  </text>
  <text x="136" y="383" fill="#30d158" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    → postiee history / search
  </text>

  <rect x="440" y="316" width="256" height="72" rx="6"
        fill="#121215" stroke="#2a2f3a" />
  <text x="454" y="338" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    WHY THIS IS THE PRODUCT
  </text>
  <text x="454" y="356" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    This local record is the only copy</text>
  <text x="454" y="370" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    that will ever exist. LinkedIn's own
  </text>
  <text x="454" y="383" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    export is static, 72h, desktop-only.
  </text>
</svg>